  "script": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "shot_id": "shot01",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "在东海最远的礁石上，有一座灯塔，亮了一百一十年。",
      "audio": "audio/line01.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 4.62
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "shot_id": "shot02",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "守灯人老周，每天爬一百二十八级台阶，只为在天黑之前，把灯点亮。",
      "audio": "audio/line02.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.14
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "shot_id": "shot03",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他常说，灯亮着，海上的人，心里就有一条回家的路。",
      "audio": "audio/line03.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.07
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "shot_id": "shot04",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "那一夜，风浪大得像要掀翻整片海，一艘小渔船，在黑暗里迷了方向。",
      "audio": "audio/line04.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.61
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "shot_id": "shot05",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "老周守着灯，整整一夜没有合眼，把最亮的那道光，推向风浪深处。",
      "audio": "audio/line05.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.53
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "shot_id": "shot06",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "天亮的时候，渔船平安靠了岸。而灯塔的灯，第一次在日出之前，熄灭了。",
      "audio": "audio/line06.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 7.42
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "shot_id": "shot06",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "从今往后，机器会替他守夜。可有些光，留在人的心里，永远都不会灭。",
      "audio": "audio/line07.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.87
    }
  ],
